  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w21.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w21.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "赤線の四本目は、震える手で引いた。出口廃止条項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "十七号室の一戦と、浮かんだ扉と、満員の証人。あの条文は、もう誰も守れない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "儀式のあと、約束どおり大工さんと出口の相談も始めた。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——その夜に、来た。黒でも白でもない、灰色の封筒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「通告: 貴殿の監督資格を、緊急規定により停止する」事由は、「興行秩序の毀損」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……興行秩序?人の自由を四つ返したことの、会社の呼び名らしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "資格停止。つまり、監督席に座れない。決勝の指揮も執れない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "付記もあった。「決勝出場は、正規任命の監督着任が条件」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——うちに、会社の監督を挿げ替える気だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "打倒まであと二本、というところで、頭を取りに来た。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w21.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "翌朝、監督席のない一週間が始まった。練習場の柵の外から、特訓を見る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "声は、届く。届くが、柵の内と外は、こんなに違う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百年ぶりに辞められなくなった女は、二年目に席を奪われた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの面々は、静かだった。静かなまま、練習の質が一段上がった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "柵の外の私に、誰かが言った。「ミミさん。柵は、規定ですか」規定です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「なら——次の赤線で、消しましょう」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この人たちは、もう、戦い方を知っている。耳が、少し熱い。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w21.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "街も、静かではなかった。柵の外に、人が集まり始めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "休止札を掲げた救護の人たち。外れ札を額に入れた胴元。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "九通の挑戦状の写しを、旗にした誰か。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.006d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.006d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——壊したルールの数だけ、柵の外に味方が立っている。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんが、受付から書式の束を抱えてきた。目が据わっていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「資格停止への異議申立。申立人の欄は——何枚あっても、いいんです」",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "何枚あっても、いい。柵の外の人だかりを見る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "書式の束を見る。……なるほど。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w21.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この勝負、署名の数で殴り合う流れらしい。事務員の喧嘩として、望むところです!",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w21.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
